/// Passes a String where the dependency's bundled stub declares an Integer.
/// That stub is the only type source for `parity_dep_cycle_ffi`, so the
/// mismatch is reported only by a surface that still reads the dependency's
/// stubs when resolution fails on the cycle.
Object subclass: Caller

  /// A `Type` warning: a live-recheck failure under `--warnings-as-errors`.
  mismatch => Erlang parity_dep_cycle_ffi double: "text"
